 "text": "As of 15 November 2026, the assembly lists 11 women and 3 non-Muslim members on reserved seats. Ashok Kumar succeeded Patrick Sant Masih following Masih’s death; his accession was a reserved-list replacement, not a by-election. Reserved seats have no geographic constituencies, and the assembly’s 2024–2029 tenure designation does not establish an exact scheduled end date."
